1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:06,406
The carpels form the gynoecium: each pistil has an ovary, a style and a stigma.

2
00:00:06,406 --> 00:00:12,239
Inside the ovary are ovules, the megasporangia, which make megaspores.

3
00:00:12,239 --> 00:00:16,992
Two different kinds of spore: angiosperms are heterosporous.

